that means you have voted
the mole out and you all win.

00:09:00.428 --> 00:09:01.950
(intense music plays)
If the lights turn red,

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:04.863
that means the mole is
still in a box and you lose.

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:12.740
(group cheers)
- Oh, good!

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:13.980
- Everybody suspicious is gone.

00:09:13.980 --> 00:09:17.453
- [Host] Will the mole
reveal themselves in 3, 2, 1.

00:09:22.876 --> 00:09:24.553
- I knew it.
- I knew it too!

00:09:24.553 --> 00:09:26.850
- I voted for you every round.
(group chatters)

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:28.713
I had my suspicions from the start.

00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:32.610
You kept saying Mormon
over and over again,

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:34.800
- I thought that too,
- [Caleb] Without flinching.

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.870
- And so I was one of
the only Mormon's there,

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:38.220
little bit part of Mormon culture.

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:39.960
I started to have doubts about the church

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:42.390
before I went to college
and I eventually was like,

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:45.330
Hmm, something's not adding
up between what I'm saying

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:46.470
and what I'm actually feeling.

00:09:46.470 --> 00:09:49.020
I'm very left-leaning politically.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:50.460
And then once I was out of the church,

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:51.840
I realized, oh, I'm gay.

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:53.460
I couldn't even think about it when I was

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:55.470
a member of the church because it was just

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:57.810
so out of the possibility in my head.

00:09:57.810 --> 00:09:59.730
But now I'm happy.
- Right

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:00.750
- I live in California.

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:04.950
If you are LGBT and in
the church, you are loved.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.597
There is a place for you,

00:10:06.597 --> 00:10:09.540
No matter if it's in the
church or out of the church.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.520
You can do whatever you want to do,

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:13.890
and whatever you need to
do that is best for you.

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:15.990
- I'm really glad to have this opportunity

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:18.480
and to talk about my
experiences with the church.

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:21.720
And I really am glad that
people can watch this

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:23.100
and listen to our stories.

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:25.080
I think that we all had some really,

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:26.640
really good thoughts shared.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.260
- Members of our church really do try

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:29.700
to live in the Savior's way,

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:31.800
and I think as we do that,

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:33.840
hopefully we can become more like him.

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:36.898
And I think as we grow as people,

00:10:36.898 --> 00:10:38.880
hopefully we'll be able
to show other people

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:41.310
that we really do love
them for who they are.

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:43.290
(group exclaiming)

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:44.510
- [Hadyn] I think we have to,

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:46.335
I think we have to
- [Z] Thank you.

00:10:46.335 --> 00:10:47.669
- Oh, he's shoving it in his pocket.

00:10:47.669 --> 00:10:50.129
(Elizabeth laughs)
- [Z] I think we have to

00:10:50.129 --> 00:10:54.762
(group laughs)
(group talks indistinctly)

00:10:54.762 --> 00:10:55.595
I was like, oh my gosh.

00:10:55.595 --> 00:10:57.732
- Oh wait, I got pockets in the back too.

00:10:57.732 --> 00:10:59.110
- [Z] Oh my gosh.

